    "title_en": "Photon Reconstruction in the Combined LXe/CsI Calorimeter of the CMD-3 Detector",
    "abstract_en": "We describe a new reconstruction algorithm developed for the combined LXe/CsI barrel calorimeter of the CMD-3 detector. The strip cathode subsystem of the liquid-xenon calorimeter is used to reconstruct close photons as well as multi-particle track and photon events. One of the results is that the detection efficiency of the $e^{+}e^{-}\\to\\pi^{0}\\gamma$ process increases from 5 to 30$\\%$ at c.m. energy of 2 GeV.",
